msgid "A system update is ready. Restart the computer to finish installing it."
msgstr "'n Stelselopdatering is gereed. Herbegin die rekenaar om die installering te voltooi."

msgid "System files need repair. This happens automatically the next time the computer restarts."
msgstr "Stelsellêers moet herstel word. Dit gebeur outomaties die volgende keer dat die rekenaar herbegin."

msgid "The web browser is not installed yet."
msgstr "Die webblaaier is nog nie geïnstalleer nie."

msgid "The web browser is ready. Sign out and sign in again to see it."
msgstr "Die webblaaier is gereed. Meld af en meld weer aan om dit te sien."

msgid "This app is not available on this device"
msgstr "Hierdie toep is nie op hierdie toestel beskikbaar nie"

msgid "This app's lock settings are not in effect, so it cannot start. Please ask your teacher."
msgstr "Hierdie toep se sluitinstellings is nie van krag nie, dus kan dit nie begin nie. Vra asseblief jou onderwyser."

msgid "Could not end your session. Please sign out and open this app from the sign-in screen."
msgstr "Kon nie jou sessie beëindig nie. Meld asseblief af en maak hierdie toep oop vanaf die aanmeldskerm."

msgid "This will end your session and open %s in locked mode."
msgstr "Dit sal jou sessie beëindig en %s in gesluitte modus oopmaak."

msgid "Newer settings could not be fetched. Please contact IT."
msgstr "Nuwer instellings kon nie gekry word nie. Kontak asseblief IT."

msgid "Settings have not been confirmed up to date for %s days. Please connect to the network; if this persists, contact IT."
msgstr "Instellings is al %s dae nie as op datum bevestig nie. Koppel asseblief aan die netwerk; as dit aanhou, kontak IT."

msgid "IT is collecting diagnostic info from this computer."
msgstr "IT versamel diagnostiese inligting van hierdie rekenaar af."
